      "beat_id": "B02",
      "t_start": 9.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 9.0,
      "narration_text": "Claude Cowork connects to a folder on your computer. You save text files in that folder — your style, your rules, your goals. Claude reads them automatically before every session. The files are the prompt. Forever. No more 500-word instruction blocks every time you start a chat.",
