      "t_start": 18.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 10.0,
      "narration_text": "The Cowork folder structure: three subfolders. About-me — three files: about-me, anti-ai-writing-style, my-company. Claude-output — you never touch this; it's where Claude stores its work. Templates — you never touch this either; it's where your favourite work formats live. Set up Global Instructions to tell Claude: always read about-me, leave the rest alone.",
